# === Runtime data (per-user; never commit) ===
# Anchored to repo root only — unanchored versions silently hid workshop
# src/memory/ for 17 days (see cba85d6, 91b2f91). Same shape would hide
# nested data/, workspace/, output/ inside level_N/ or solutions/.
/data/
/workspace/
!workspace.example/
/output/
/data/*.db
/data/*.db-journal
/data/*.pid

